sentences.text:
Undisputedly, the suit land belonging to the claimant situate in Mohal Dungi Kandyon, Sub Tehsil Dadahu, District Sirmaur, H.P., as detailed in the award(s), came to be acquired for public purpose;
namely; construction of "Renuka Ji Dam and its submergence area"
and acquisition proceedings commenced with the issuance of Notifications under Section 4 of the Act on 28.2.2009 and 26.5.2009, respectively.
